               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>D&amp;C yellow no. 10, gelatin, glycerin, polyethylene glycol 400, povidone k 30, propylene glycol, purified water, sorbitol sorbitan solution</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250729"/>
            </section>
